⍝ )MIDI (V98): lists $APLHOME/midi/ as )IMAG lists images/ (the same code), every file, names as on disk
)MIDI
⍝ extra letters are ignored, as for every command
)MIDIS
⍝ a pattern: leading letters, case ignored, * anywhere
)MIDI T
)MIDI *M3
)MIDI zzz
⍝ a folder that isn't there, and a file given as a folder
)MIDI nosuch/
)MIDI chords.mid/
⍝ )IMAG still lists images/
)IMAG b
